  "body": "Vendors have made their instructions clear - this home will be SOLD!\r\n\r\nBuilt by GJ Gardner and beautifully presented throughout, this modern 3 beds home offers the perfect balance of style, comfort and low-maintenance living. Thoughtfully designed with a practical layout, it delivers easy everyday living and effortless entertaining.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a sleek contemporary kitchen featuring stone benchtop, quality appliances, gas cooking and ample storage. The open-plan living and dining area is light-filled and inviting, flowing seamlessly to an outdoor entertaining space and private landscaped courtyard.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom is well-appointed with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while the remaining 2 double bedrooms are serviced by a stylish family bathroom. Whether you're downsizing, purchasing your first home or seeking a lock-and-leave lifestyle, this home offers comfort without compromise.\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n* Built by GJ Gardner with the balance of 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n* Easy-care, lock-and-leave lifestyle\r\n* Open-plan living with excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Modern kitchen with stone benchtops and quality appliances\r\n* Two stylish bathrooms + guest toilet + internal-access garage\r\n* Private, fully fenced and landscaped courtyard\r\n* Two heat pumps and three underfloor heating systems for year-round comfort\r\n* Freehold title - No Body Corporate fees\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of being just minutes from Stanmore Bay Beach, local parks, schools, cafés, shopping and everyday amenities, while still having the relaxed coastal atmosphere that makes this part of the Hibiscus Coast so desirable. \r\n\r\nConjunctional sales with all agencies are warmly welcomed.\r\n\r\nContact Tim and Amy 021 055 2650 today to arrange your private viewing or visit our open home to experience it for yourself.",
